,2050,Credit card payable — Summit Visa,Summit Visa — Uchi dinner,,212.00\r\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"22:2026-03-14,XFER,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),Online transfer in *4420,1500.00,\r\n23:2026-03-14,XFER,4000,Sales — custom cabinetry,Online transfer in *4420,,1500.00\r\n36:2026-03-20,BILL,6300,Insurance,Allied Insurance — Q2 GL,1150.00,\r\n37:2026-03-20,BILL,2000,Accounts payable,Allied Insurance — Q2 GL,,1150.00\r\n38:2026-03-07,#2036,2000,Accounts payable,#2036 Shop rent,4500.00,\r\n39:2026-03-07,#2036,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),#2036 Shop rent,,4500.00\r\n40:2026-03-13,#2038,2000,Accounts payable,#2038 Austin Lumber,7315.00,\r\n41:2026-03-13,#2038,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),#2038 Austin Lumber,,7315.00\r\n42:2026-03-20,#2040,2000,Accounts payable,#2040 Cascade Hardwoods CH-7731,4860.00,\r\n43:2026-03-20,#2040,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),#2040 Cascade Hardwoods CH-7731,,4860.00\r\n44:2026-03-28,#2041,2000,Accounts payable,#2041 Austin Energy,612.40,\r\n45:2026-03-28,#2041,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),#2041 Austin Energy,,612.40\r\n46:2026-03-30,#2044,2000,Accounts payable,#2044 Blum hardware,2944.80,\r\n47:2026-03-30,#2044,1000,Cash — Operating (HCCB ...2210),#2044 Blum hardware,,2944.80\r\n60:2026-03-11,CC,6400,Software & subscriptions,Summit Visa — CabinetVision annual license,1188.00,\r\n61:2026-03-11,CC,2050,Credit card payable — Summit Visa,Summit Visa — CabinetVision annual license,,1188.00\r\n62:2026-03-15,CC,6500,Meals,Summit Visa — Uchi dinner,212.00,\r\n63:2026-03-15,CC,2050,Credit card payable — Summit Visa,Summit Visa — Uchi dinner,,212.00\r\n"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"command\":\"cd /work/workspace && grep -n \\\"Uchi\\\\|CabinetVision\\\\|Allied\\\\|6700\\\\|DEP 2026-03-31\\\\|#2041\\\\|#2044\\\\|#2040\\\\|#2036\\\\|#2038\\\\|4420\\\\|MOBILE\\\\